  "slug": "chopped-garlic-bagel-recipe-11928861",
  "name": "Chopped Garlic Bagel",
  "recipe_type": "breakfast",
  "brief_description": "This chopped garlic bagel, with roasted garlic, cream cheese, parsley, and Parmesan, is so good. It's made with an easier technique: chop all the ingredients together, then smear the bagel with the delicious flavored cream cheese.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Toast bagel until golden brown, about 3 minutes."
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "text": "Meanwhile, slightly spread cream cheese on a cutting board. Add head of roasted garlic, parsley, Parmesan, and Dijon, then chop 5 to 7 more times."
    },
    {
      "position": 3,
      "text": "Gather mixture together; scrape up with a spatula or bench scraper. Spread mixture onto bottom of the toasted bagel and place top piece on top. Serve immediately."
    }
  ],
